   SerializedTypeInfo.cpp and every per-bundle file) shows exactly 28
   changed lines - every emitted `#if OS(WINDOWS)` / `#if OS(DARWIN)`
   guard of the two types' variants gains `&& !USE(UNIX_DOMAIN_SOCKETS)`;
   nothing else changes.

2. Compile-shape matrix (g++ -std=c++23 -fsyntax-only, verbatim-extracted
   encode/decode blocks from the real generated file, real-class stubs
   mirroring ConnectionHandle.h / SharedMemory.h member layout, real
   wtf/IsIncreasing.h):

     PRE  + MinGW GTK (UNIX=1,WINDOWS=1)  -> FAIL, reproducing every CI
                                             error class (static_assert
                                             is_same failure, duplicate
                                             m_handle member, redefinition
                                             of auto m_handle, no matching
                                             constructor for the 2-arg /
                                             3-arg braced initializers)
     PRE  + Linux GTK  (UNIX=1)           -> PASS
     POST + MinGW GTK  (UNIX=1,WINDOWS=1) -> PASS   <-- fix target
     POST + Linux GTK  (UNIX=1)           -> PASS   (no regression)
     POST + WinCairo   (UNIX=0,WINDOWS=1) -> PASS   (no regression)
     POST + Darwin     (UNIX=0,DARWIN=1)  -> PASS   (no regression)

3. Scope sweep: grepped all 329 manifests for platform-conditioned
